<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Your order has shipped — FishingPoster.com</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">

  <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">It's on the way.</h1>

  <p>Order <strong>#{{ order_number }}</strong> shipped via <strong>{{ carrier }}</strong>.</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    Tracking number: <strong>{{ tracking_number }}</strong>
  </p>

  {% if tracking_url %}
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <a href="{{ tracking_url }}" style="display: inline-block; background: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600;">Track your package</a>
  </p>
  {% endif %}

  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 32px;">
    Thanks for ordering from FishingPoster.com. If anything looks off when
    it arrives, just reply to this email — we'll make it right.
  </p>

</body>
</html>
